# Per-run analysis output. Written by the pipeline on every upload and points
# at paths inside the gitignored pipeline_out/, so a committed copy is stale
# on any other machine - and it carries real detection results from whatever
# footage was last processed, which is not something to push to a shared repo.
/public/api/events.json
